  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "fix(cflow): restore port context for data link frames",
  "description": "When dissecting IPFIX dataLinkFrameSection fields, the cflow dissector\npasses the embedded frame to the Ethernet dissector. That nested\ndissection can update pinfo->ptype, pinfo->srcport, and pinfo->destport\nto describe the embedded packet.\n\nCflow template lookup keys include the exporter and collector ports. The\ndissector already restored the packet addresses after dissecting an\nembedded frame, but it did not restore the port context. As a result, a\nlater data set in the same IPFIX message could fail to find a template\nthat was already cached.\n\nSave and restore the packet port context around the embedded Ethernet\ndissection, matching the existing address restoration.\n\nTested with a sample pcap containing an IPFIX template packet followed\nby data packets using template IDs 256 and 257.\n\n[ipfix_samples_udp.pcap](/uploads/c04048eef60329c90f090ec339d0cc00/ipfix_samples_udp.pcap)\n\nInstalled tshark version:\n\n```\n/Applications/Wireshark.app/Contents/MacOS/tshark --version | head -n 1\nTShark (Wireshark) 4.6.6 (v4.6.6-0-g3a22c3ef473d).\n```\n\nInstalled tshark result:\n\n```\n/Applications/Wireshark.app/Contents/MacOS/tshark -r /private/tmp/ipfix_samples_udp.pcapng -Y cflow -T fields -e frame.number -e _ws.col.Info -e cflow.flowset_id -e cflow.template_frame -e _ws.expert.message\n1\tIPFIX flow ( 204 bytes) Obs-Domain-ID=    0 [Data-Template:256,257]\t2\n2\tIPFIX flow ( 448 bytes) Obs-Domain-ID=    0 [Data:256] [Data:257]\t256,257\t1,1\t[...]\n3\tIPFIX flow (1056 bytes) Obs-Domain-ID=    0 [Data:257] [Data:256]\t257,256\t1\t[...]Data (596 bytes), no template found\n```\n\nFixed tshark version:\n\n```\nbuild/run/tshark --version | head -n 1\nTShark (Wireshark) 4.7.0 (v4.7.0rc0-3104-ga9f2c651f1a0).\n```\n\nFixed tshark result:\n\n```\nbuild/run/tshark -r /private/tmp/ipfix_samples_udp.pcapng -Y cflow -T fields -e frame.number -e _ws.col.Info -e cflow.flowset_id -e cflow.template_frame -e _ws.expert.message\n1\tIPFIX flow ( 204 bytes) Obs-Domain-ID=    0 [Data-Template:256,257]\t2\n2\tIPFIX flow ( 448 bytes) Obs-Domain-ID=    0 [Data:256] [Data:257]\t256,257\t1,1\t[...]\n3\tIPFIX flow (1056 bytes) Obs-Domain-ID=    0 [Data:257] [Data:256]\t257,256\t1,1\t[...]\n```\n\nAI-Assisted: yes",
